## What's This Plugin

[](#whats-this-plugin)

oh-my-opencode-slim is an agent orchestration plugin for OpenCode. It includes a built-in team of specialized agents that can scout a codebase, look up fresh documentation, review architecture, handle UI work, and execute well-scoped implementation tasks under one orchestrator.

The main idea is simple: instead of forcing one model to do everything, the plugin routes each part of the job to the agent best suited for it, balancing **quality, speed and cost**. The Orchestrator plans the work graph, dispatches specialists as background tasks, and reconciles their results before continuing.

### ✨ Highlights

[](#-highlights)

-   **[Seven specialized agents](#meet-the-pantheon)** - Orchestrator, Explorer, Oracle, Council, Librarian, Designer, and Fixer. Each part of the job goes to the agent best suited for it - mix any models across any providers.
-   **[Background orchestration](/alvinunreal/oh-my-opencode-slim/blob/master/docs/background-orchestration.md)** - the Orchestrator dispatches specialists as background tasks, tracks them, and reconciles results before continuing - parallel work by default.
-   **[Bundled skills](#skills)** - prompt-based workflows like `deepwork`, `codemap`, `verification-planning`, and `reflect`, assigned per agent.
-   **[Council](/alvinunreal/oh-my-opencode-slim/blob/master/docs/council.md)** - run multiple models in parallel on the same question and synthesize a single answer with `@council`.
-   **[Companion](/alvinunreal/oh-my-opencode-slim/blob/master/docs/companion.md)** - an optional floating desktop window showing which agents are active, including parallel background specialists.
-   **[Multiplexer integration](/alvinunreal/oh-my-opencode-slim/blob/master/docs/multiplexer-integration.md)** - watch agents work live in Tmux, Zellij, Herdr, cmux, or kitty panes.
-   **[Preset switching](/alvinunreal/oh-my-opencode-slim/blob/master/docs/preset-switching.md)** - swap the whole team's models at runtime with `/preset`.
-   **[Code intelligence tools](/alvinunreal/oh-my-opencode-slim/blob/master/docs/tools.md)** - LSP tools, AST-aware search across 25 languages, and built-in MCPs for docs and GitHub code search.
-   **[Fully customizable](/alvinunreal/oh-my-opencode-slim/blob/master/docs/configuration.md)** - custom agents, prompt overrides, per-agent skill/MCP permissions, and [project-local customization](/alvinunreal/oh-my-opencode-slim/blob/master/docs/project-local-customization.md).

